{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "Voice Appointment Intake \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HVoice Appointment Intake\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nA local Whisper model transcribes audio. A conservative parser extracts unambiguous date/time inputs or requests clarification. Even confirmed intake is not a booking; availability belongs to a separate booking service.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HVoice Appointment Intake\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:23.799590+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0003,\r\n  \"result\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"proposal\",\r\n      \"date\": \"2030-06-17\",\r\n      \"time\": \"09:00\",\r\n      \"timezone\": \"Europe/Madrid\",\r\n      \"transcript\": \"Please book an appointment on 2030-06-17 at 09:00.\",\r\n      \"requires_confirmation\": true,\r\n      \"booked\": false\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"clarify\",\r\n      \"question\": \"Please confirm one date (YYYY-MM-DD) and one time (HH:MM).\",\r\n      \"transcript\": \"Can I come next Friday?\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"clarify\",\r\n      \"question\": \"That date or time is invalid. Please correct it.\",\r\n      \"transcript\": \"I want an appointment on 2030-02-31 at 09:00.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"status\": \"clarify\",\r\n      \"question\": \"Please confirm one date (YYYY-MM-DD) and one time (HH:MM).\",\r\n      \"transcript\": \"Cancel my appointment.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"]
[20, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HVoice Appointment Intake\r\nBehavior under test\r\n\r\n.....                                                                    [100%]\r\n5 passed in 0.00s"]
[30, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HVoice Appointment Intake\r\nMeasured evaluation / fixture mode\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"passed\": true,\r\n  \"cases\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"text\": \"Please book an appointment on 2030-06-17 at 09:00.\",\r\n      \"expected\": \"proposal\",\r\n      \"actual\": \"proposal\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"text\": \"Can I come next Friday?\",\r\n      \"expected\": \"clarify\",\r\n      \"actual\": \"clarify\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"text\": \"I want an appointment on 2030-02-31 at 09:00.\",\r\n      \"expected\": \"clarify\",\r\n      \"actual\": \"clarify\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"text\": \"Cancel my appointment.\",\r\n      \"expected\": \"clarify\",\r\n      \"actual\": \"clarify\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"mode_detail\": \"Transcript parser only; this is not speech recognition evaluation.\"\r\n}"]
[40, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HVoice Appointment Intake\r\nTradeoffs to explain at interview\r\n\r\nThe bundled audio is synthetic macOS speech, not a human recording. English-only tiny.en and a conservative date parser are small baselines. No telephony integration, diarization or voice cloning is included.\r\n"]
[50, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HVoice Appointment Intake\r\nRun it yourself\r\n\r\ngit clone https://github.com/danielpdev/voice-appointment-intake.git\r\ncd voice-appointment-intake\r\nmake setup\r\nmake demo\r\nmake test\r\nmake eval\r\n\r\nSee README.md and docs/INTERVIEW_RO.md.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted portfolio project. Synthetic data.\r\nNo production customer claims."]
